/-!
# Actual kinetic viscous exhaustion on one whole mild receipt

The actual rowwise viscous work already contains one spectral multiplier.
Dividing each nonzero row payment by that same multiplier recovers its
unweighted physical-time vorticity mass.  Summing over the canonical
source-owned cubes and exhausting the radius therefore converges to the
complete whole-carrier viscous payment of the identical receipt.

No cutoff, summability witness, tail estimate, or target trajectory enters
the theorem mouth.  This module is a same-event readout/consumer of the
existing whole mild receipt and its canonical Fourier inventories.
-/

